{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/991e9a11c89af576a4cf5e620e34b202.avif?t=1774985087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras_big/991e9a11c89af576a4cf5e620e34b202.webp?t=1774985087 width=1560 height=219 /></span><strong>A cozy adventure through myth and memory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mingma, a girl born into a new Medieval order after the\u00a0<strong>\u0f46\u0f74\u0f0b\u0f63\u0f7c\u0f42\u0f0b\u0f46\u0f7a\u0f53\u0f0b\u0f54\u0f7c</strong> (Great Flood), sees her world shatter when an army of dragon-machine hybrid creatures invade and bring ruin to her village with eldritch technology that siphons the life force of humans. Separated from her family amidst the chaos, Mingma inadvertently catapults herself through a spacetime rift, entering the Bardo, a forgotten purgatory realm between life, death, and rebirth. With this newfound dimension-walking ability, she must awaken to her true self - while travelling 108 days and nights - through a post-apocalyptic Himalayan world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse the corrupted </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the living world, corrupted beings roam. You must purify them through compassion. Players experience occasional transitions from platforming to a turn-based ritual mode to encourage slowing down and strategizing rather than simply button mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.poster.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.webm?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.mp4?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse sacred realms and face divine trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by ancient teachings and haunted by karmic echoes, you must navigate the dreamlike landscapes of  the Bardo, where deities test your spirit through trials of wisdom, courage, and clarity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/725f67c311d6057b5e066b506d12bc39.poster.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/725f67c311d6057b5e066b506d12bc39.webm?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/725f67c311d6057b5e066b506d12bc39.mp4?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel forgotten truths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate environmental puzzles inspired by sacred geometry and ritual symbolism. Discover lost relics imbued with magical power, and unlock skill upgrades that deepen your connection to the spiritual and elemental forces around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/cb5bba5dd13d23aff4752d822bcc0d7f.poster.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/cb5bba5dd13d23aff4752d822bcc0d7f.webm?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/cb5bba5dd13d23aff4752d822bcc0d7f.mp4?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stop and breathe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle, reflective prompts appear during dialogue or scene transitions to encourage grounding and presence between gameplay segments. Players earn meaningful in-game bonuses for taking breaks, reinforcing rest as part of the character\u2019s well-being and fostering empathy with her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/bd8b083cfbba9129325687cd6a9a4cab.poster.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/bd8b083cfbba9129325687cd6a9a4cab.webm?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/bd8b083cfbba9129325687cd6a9a4cab.mp4?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night activity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light 2D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindful gameplay and pacing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich story and dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack from award-winning Tibetan musician</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/6024db81de4cd00d68708eed279863bf.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f<i><strong>Will you emerge enlightened, or be lost in the cycles of rebirth?\u00a0</strong></i>\ud83c\udf00</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136230?t=1774985087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136230?t=1774985087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/5446b1540de05b32a2c66c5cb82ca22e71c20ccd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774985087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/5446b1540de05b32a2c66c5cb82ca22e71c20ccd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774985087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/991e9a11c89af576a4cf5e620e34b202.avif?t=1774985087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras_big/991e9a11c89af576a4cf5e620e34b202.webp?t=1774985087 width=1560 height=219 /></span><strong>A cozy adventure through myth and memory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mingma, a girl born into a new Medieval order after the\u00a0<strong>\u0f46\u0f74\u0f0b\u0f63\u0f7c\u0f42\u0f0b\u0f46\u0f7a\u0f53\u0f0b\u0f54\u0f7c</strong> (Great Flood), sees her world shatter when an army of dragon-machine hybrid creatures invade and bring ruin to her village with eldritch technology that siphons the life force of humans. Separated from her family amidst the chaos, Mingma inadvertently catapults herself through a spacetime rift, entering the Bardo, a forgotten purgatory realm between life, death, and rebirth. With this newfound dimension-walking ability, she must awaken to her true self - while travelling 108 days and nights - through a post-apocalyptic Himalayan world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse the corrupted </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the living world, corrupted beings roam. You must purify them through compassion. Players experience occasional transitions from platforming to a turn-based ritual mode to encourage slowing down and strategizing rather than simply button mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.poster.avif?t=1774985087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.webm?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136230/extras/4ab64777bb938a8e0812d48396c628d7.mp4?t=1774985087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse sacred realms and face divine trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by ancient teachings and haunted by karmic echoes, you must navigate the dreamlike landscapes of  the Bardo, where deities test your spirit through trials of wisdom, courage, and clarity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=